          "media": {
            "duration": 4075,
            "fileSize": 65171277
          },
          "abridged": false,
          "author": "Big Bible Stories for Little Hearts",
          "description": "When God’s love is planted in our hearts, something amazing starts to sprout—the Fruit of the Spirit! Kids will giggle, sing, and learn through this collection of engaging Bible stories that show what love, joy, peace, patience, kindness, goodness, faithfulness, gentleness, and self-control look like in real life. Sing along with Paul and Silas as they praise in prison, learn from peace-making Abigail, walk with Elijah as he experiences God’s gentleness, and more! Each original, scripture-packed song helps kids memorize God’s Word in a fun and joyful way, featuring the happy sounds of violin, banjo, steel guitar, and piano. Get ready for music, laughter, and faith to bloom as God’s love grows fruit that lasts!",
